e of the man's actions. Therefore, the man can be convicted of felony murder for both deaths.\n\nAnswer: D", "output_sha256": "79a0e71374f8e86cc3ffb8aa80f35cbf3dbc5cc754610461544a58c50de04c81", "gold": "D", "ts": 1790125944.029999}
