e by inspecting the client's bank statements and cash receipt records (Option A). This ensures that the auditor can still obtain sufficient and appropriate audit evidence without confirming the account receivable.\n\nAnswer: A", "output_sha256": "c7866200c1f74e281fb864917b44c89571a4deb29665ee13091a7f87eb1d40ad", "gold": "A", "ts": 1790125944.1000793}
