)$ - This is not a requirement for consistency, unbiasedness, or efficiency. It is a specific distribution assumption, which is not necessary for these properties.\n\nGiven these points, the assumptions required for consistency, unbiasedness, and efficiency are (i), (ii), and (iii).\n\nAnswer: C", "output_sha256": "c4f71aceb0b755cfc6b84012a98c3d5501aa9b858517672f91d8f01a268b95ad", "gold": "C", "ts": 1790125958.9618175}
