ling the diamond is impossible in fact. In this case, the defendants planned to steal trade secrets, but the FBI agent was actually holding recipes and gardening tips, which are not trade secrets. Thus, the act of stealing trade secrets is impossible in fact.\n\nGiven the scenario, the defendants are claiming that the act of stealing trade secrets is impossible in fact because the FBI agent was holding recipes and gardening tips, not trade secrets. This is a case of factual impossibility.\n\nAnswer: D", "output_sha256": "8d89b6cdc1fa6f559fc1fb8df78a2332df0928ebeceb627527dc5fd2a761a4e1", "gold": "C", "ts": 1790125961.595607}
