l definition of a non-stochastic variable.\n\nConsidering the definitions and the context of non-stochastic variables, the most appropriate choice is:\n\nAnswer: B", "output_sha256": "d6e231fddb55be9412cb107653f493193c2ea834f38cc813d6fa205e70e920a6", "gold": "B", "ts": 1790125966.384768}
