from DVD players: \\(4x \\times 40 = 160x\\)\n- Contribution margin from home entertainment systems: \\(x \\times 140 = 140x\\)\n\nTotal contribution margin = \\(160x + 140x = 300x\\)\n\nThe break-even point is when the total contribution margin equals the fixed costs:\n\\[300x = 90000\\]\n\\[x = \\frac{90000}{300} = 300\\]\n\nSince \\(x\\) represents the number of home entertainment systems sold, and for every 4 DVD players sold, 1 home entertainment system is sold, the number of DVD players sold is:\n\\[4x = 4 \\times 300 = 1200\\]\n\nAnswer: C", "output_sha256": "bae1e5c14a74e40fffdd32a24a3780057b05dc41602655946602af51c12242fe", "gold": "C", "ts": 1790125968.8013315}
