pany is trying to reach, rather than a component of the marketing mix itself.\nD. Pricing: This is one of the 4Ps.\n\nAnswer: C", "output_sha256": "4144c1027603a5be5c6982c6be91a182ba3b76bffb6e0e847137e934b749363e", "gold": "C", "ts": 1790125979.119379}
