ant would be liable for the damage caused by their friend.\n\nAnswer: A", "output_sha256": "e4b115732bf27af2d964e56af91e4e879c9c42b4f0836f74276ac7bfb7251fc3", "gold": "B", "ts": 1790125980.10601}
