ty. This is not applicable because the nonconformity is a material defect that cannot be easily corrected.\n\nOption C states that the posters do not conform to the contract. This is correct because the reversal of the image is a material defect that does not conform to the agreed-upon specifications.\n\nOption D suggests a breach of an implied warranty of fitness for a particular purpose. While this might be applicable in some cases, it is not the most direct or relevant option given the specific nature of the nonconformity.\n\nAnswer: C", "output_sha256": "340f98030f859d5743834c6e355e40b231ca13d4f883aecbb7a548f39acaa427", "gold": "C", "ts": 1790125982.392006}
