\nOption C suggests a duty to warn of any known dangerous conditions, which aligns with the gym's knowledge of the malfunctioning dryer and the \"DO NOT USE\" sign.\n\nAnswer: C", "output_sha256": "6b71e2ede3886b02a3da06edfdc73fcd8c798aab3fc253800ef8e362e7484376", "gold": "C", "ts": 1790125985.4485161}
