 including vertices with degree 0 (isolated vertices) or vertices with degree 1. However, it does not have to have at least one vertex with degree 1. This statement is not necessarily true.\n\nGiven the analysis, statements I and II must be true.\n\nAnswer: D", "output_sha256": "0cd7c99817d56bc5ab3bf639da44c8878f4e5d141ad9a18d0f0e166e438796ba", "gold": "D", "ts": 1790125986.673099}
