olve advocacy.\n- Option D involves providing legal services to the client in a foreign jurisdiction, which is not allowed.\n\nAnswer: C", "output_sha256": "353a4ac9a037ff648f51154915db07c6b248d7783f835bc6c146a89617d2c8e4", "gold": "C", "ts": 1790125987.0712087}
