pically amortized for tax purposes.\n\nC. Stock issuance costs: These are generally amortized over the period of the related debt, which is typically the life of the debt instrument.\n\nD. Organizational meeting costs: These are also considered startup costs and are not generally amortized for tax purposes.\n\nGiven this analysis, the most appropriate answer is:\n\nAnswer: A", "output_sha256": "5494ea8bd75234312724c21c89b2c96963f6584468a8a2d811b724efde9c5817", "gold": "C", "ts": 1790125991.0703032}
