 stop. The initial stop was for speeding, and the search for cocaine was a separate and independent action that did not have a lawful basis.\n\nGiven these points, the search of the car for cocaine was not conducted incident to the arrest and did not have a lawful basis. Therefore, it would be considered an unreasonable, warrantless search.\n\nAnswer: A", "output_sha256": "9408c3c4ecba882b5c4df88426027226a7d6203526490fc21740c6342b5f8567", "gold": "A", "ts": 1790126005.8161533}
