ions directly caused the barber to suffer a heart attack due to fear and stress.\n\nTherefore, the barber would likely prevail in a suit for infliction of emotional distress and damages arising from the heart attack, as the security guard's actions were intentional and foreseeable.\n\nAnswer: D", "output_sha256": "2216d76eebc415a9293a040fddb33d89870d8243e2b843230f3550e03d633103", "gold": "A", "ts": 1790126009.8830762}
