nt variable from a linear regression model: This is not an example of mis-specification. It is an example of omitted variable bias, which is a common issue in regression analysis but not mis-specification of the functional form.\n\nAnswer: D", "output_sha256": "a888c0ab8a0763df6ed135622e68365046efb14ca8f2cfea0fc04a5d4952c0c3", "gold": "D", "ts": 1790126021.3445878}
