\cdot w \\]\n\nSimplifying this inequality:\n\\[ y < x \\]\n\nThis can be rewritten as:\n\\[ \\frac{1}{x} < \\frac{1}{y} \\]\n\nTaking reciprocals (and reversing the inequality):\n\\[ \\frac{1}{w} + \\frac{1}{x} < \\frac{1}{y} + \\frac{1}{z} \\]\n\nThus, the condition is:\n\\[ 1/w + 1/x < 1/y + 1/z \\]\n\nAnswer: D", "output_sha256": "03fcdbf06850f7fc5bde9403adcd57cc1b9abab33c07fb2268129cc8df6f72b0", "gold": "B", "ts": 1790126042.5457332}
