ts, the correct choice for increasing stability is:\n\nAnswer: C", "output_sha256": "b9b6d153fbbafd6277214442d1a907c9d9a5c5f2496b44c65b0ae41640bcaea3", "gold": "D", "ts": 1790126043.014118}
