g the plaintiff an opportunity to deny or explain her statement.\n- This option is incorrect because the defendant did lay a foundation by calling the police accident investigator to testify.\n\nD. Excluded, because the plaintiff's statement to the investigator is hearsay.\n- This option is correct because the statement made to the investigator is hearsay, and hearsay is generally not admissible unless an exception applies. Here, there is no exception for the statement being made in the course of official duties.\n\nAnswer: D", "output_sha256": "ab9d696b191a2e1e8ec4fcf426ff32804315749b43a69dbebdd533c7ebd31242", "gold": "A", "ts": 1790126051.8589566}
