sion under the privilege against self-incrimination, nor would it be admissible as work-product material under the work-product rule.\n\nAnswer: C", "output_sha256": "0a677fc7c22818353cc11ac570662f7b798352ae7c93fd3709edf7a2c8a02731", "gold": "D", "ts": 1790126064.5416298}
