uggests inherent authority, but the treaty specifically grants the President this authority, making this option redundant.\n\nAnswer: C", "output_sha256": "2172b26c929a569d0ba3be5a4561afeb7588ff62e275fb7e98014bf75bd6c3d3", "gold": "C", "ts": 1790126068.2033625}
