an degrade performance.\n\nD. Symbol table lookup: Hash tables are commonly used for symbol tables, where operations like lookup, insert, and delete are performed efficiently.\n\nGiven this analysis, the problem that Hash tables cannot efficiently solve is Range search.\n\nAnswer: C", "output_sha256": "a88635b2b86d1bcdcf4ce85949046a62fa0711899cac03a96fb8b67bfe83073c", "gold": "C", "ts": 1790126070.9284537}
