 (True)\n- (iv) It must have a constant probability distribution (False, as the probability distribution can change over time in non-stationary processes)\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is:\n\nAnswer: B", "output_sha256": "2103681e9027b667622066fccf05940196caec761b4f8d42de762fabe4b857a3", "gold": "C", "ts": 1790128735.0642982}
