ies: The Ford-Fulkerson algorithm, which is a greedy approach, can be used to find a maximum flow. It repeatedly finds augmenting paths and increases the flow along these paths until no more augmenting paths can be found.\n\nGiven the analysis, only problem I can be solved by a standard greedy algorithm.\n\nAnswer: A", "output_sha256": "1b3e3110641aeaf7825ca153a6f9381ab42a4cadd001c4001cbbf41efbf8b726", "gold": "A", "ts": 1790128740.485381}
