en variables through experiments or longitudinal studies.\n- **D. Focus-groups**: Similar to consumer juries, this method is used to understand consumer opinions and preferences but does not establish causality.\n\nAnswer: C", "output_sha256": "69c5143c1c49dcde50be30a8e9366f995a9cf9d861eff88899393c5284fb8800", "gold": "C", "ts": 1790128746.1536067}
