ven this, the best representation of the given equation is:\n\nAnswer: A", "output_sha256": "7fe0bbf9c8433209fd2d7e3694de92f08ffc499f31cb301445239bfca78a71ea", "gold": "A", "ts": 1790128750.4677908}
