n the heat of passion.\n\nD. The defendant acted without deliberation and premeditation.\n- This is consistent with voluntary manslaughter, where the defendant acted impulsively in the heat of passion rather than with premeditation.\n\nAnswer: A", "output_sha256": "139586324cf302c183c60bc5d4203a844992737d551d4f6595f08eaff1ce972b", "gold": "A", "ts": 1790128751.8937392}
