ts that need to be reworked due to defects. This directly measures internal failure costs, as rework is a form of internal failure cost.\n\nD. Tracking warranty expenses over time: This technique monitors the costs associated with providing warranties, which are related to external failure costs rather than internal failure costs.\n\nGiven the analysis, the technique that effectively measures improvements in product quality as a result of internal failure costs is:\n\nAnswer: C", "output_sha256": "3c5d2db85b392a8632963354c2593705e128446596539425b45d7a658deceaa6", "gold": "C", "ts": 1790128763.072956}
