ash flow patterns or when the discount rate changes.\n\nD. We should use a single metric, like the NPV or the IRR, to have a coherent comparison.\n- Using a single metric like NPV or IRR can be misleading. Projects with different cash flow patterns or risk profiles might be ranked incorrectly by a single metric.\n\nConsidering the analysis, the most accurate statement is:\n\nAnswer: D", "output_sha256": "fda3af0c2f4320839e2920e47e3244c808cac94d9992a258c26fc173003d9696", "gold": "C", "ts": 1790128766.489851}
