ployed)\n- Autonomy (lack of)\n\nThus, the correct option is C.\n\nAnswer: C", "output_sha256": "ccfbce59f5bef5282dcad58e4420e162c04f14a7aff0a52309ac56dc8f7104e8", "gold": "A", "ts": 1790128770.7639675}
