quired Rate of Return}_B = 7\\% + 1.4 \\times (10\\% - 7\\%) \\]\n\\[ \\text{Required Rate of Return}_B = 7\\% + 1.4 \\times 3\\% \\]\n\\[ \\text{Required Rate of Return}_B = 7\\% + 4.2\\% \\]\n\\[ \\text{Required Rate of Return}_B = 11.2\\% \\]\n\nTherefore, the required rate of return for Stocks A and B are 9.4% and 11.2%, respectively.\n\nAnswer: A", "output_sha256": "67574a3c60ee1a20c6b1ab5afe9347a1608b4420e9fbf0c28bcbd35e878f08a1", "gold": "A", "ts": 1790128791.4182177}
