ct products liability is valid because the dishwasher was defective and the defect caused the injury. The fact that the buyer was the purchaser and the buyer's personal injury are not relevant to the strict products liability claim.\n\nAnswer: A", "output_sha256": "316af0e9a450b0a2831e5e75169da2e5a00ff4437270a806bf301478b6feaf08", "gold": "A", "ts": 1790128799.3885171}
