 Therefore, it is hearsay not within any recognized exception.\n\nAnswer: D", "output_sha256": "1db3e5c1f4483356eff9e25cae16db4ed45c9bb2cc95ffd5f4e6ea075ff5daa2", "gold": "A", "ts": 1790128813.969307}
