d worst-case running times of O(n log n) is Merge sort.\n\nAnswer: C", "output_sha256": "cde100a027ebbb9be81c596bef60ca7d44f57d8f3b195ba23105715121977b4e", "gold": "C", "ts": 1790128818.0499232}
