This is a benefit of penetration testing. If a system is secure when tested in isolation, it is more likely to remain secure when integrated with other components.\n\nD. Makes an adversarial neural network converge more quickly - This is not a benefit of penetration testing. Penetration testing is a manual security practice and does not involve neural networks or their convergence.\n\nAnswer: C", "output_sha256": "6b1c076fb6a84f8604ba8348b6605d01feb91b1d52449d6302be552f61bc9114", "gold": "A", "ts": 1790128824.1237266}
