nning and end of the month.\n\nGiven:\n- Accounts payable at June 1 = $85,000\n- Accounts payable at June 30 = $75,000\n\nThe cash disbursements for June purchases would be:\n\\[ \\text{Cash Disbursements} = \\text{Purchases} - \\text{Increase in Accounts Payable} \\]\n\\[ \\text{Cash Disbursements} = 330,000 - (75,000 - 85,000) = 330,000 - (-10,000) = 340,000 \\]\n\nAnswer: D", "output_sha256": "621e17d540009ab8710377a0f29c214c32488fc659e747c64754913b266fcba7", "gold": "D", "ts": 1790128873.1807246}
