inderman (in this case, the woman) has the right to demand that the life tenant account for any profits made from such waste.\n\nAnswer: B", "output_sha256": "c87209b31763b36244e25dc1383d227a9e1be198809ab7c56eca793bf7ad9ff4", "gold": "B", "ts": 1790128874.6959474}
