 zeros are arranged alternatively on the negative real axis, this characteristic is consistent with the behavior of an **RLC network**.\n\nAnswer: D", "output_sha256": "c50d6d3ff4fcd42279b8d6890762a912220bb0462d7e4ccc706666e36ccf417b", "gold": "D", "ts": 1790128877.101308}
