e.\" The man is seeking specific performance, which is an action in personam (directed at the buyer) rather than an action in rem (directed at the property).\n\n4. **Necessity of Third Party**: In an action for specific performance, the third party (the actual owner) is not a necessary party. The buyer is the party who is in breach of the contract by refusing to pay and take possession.\n\nGiven these points, the correct answer is:\n\nAnswer: C", "output_sha256": "39fc8b6a2c88a84126cdcef66e5f0a54bb25aebaaa4aee626bffd47b2c37c6ee", "gold": "D", "ts": 1790128879.6452332}
