panies do not ask for such personal information via email.\n\nD. An e-mail indicates that you have won a large sum of money and asks you to enter your bank account number so that the money can be transferred to you\n- This is highly suspicious because winning money via email is a common phishing tactic.\n\nAnswer: D", "output_sha256": "541bde8f7bb243f8dfd0491316d88b6be51bd93bb711bd0db9f55ed5ab93da02", "gold": "A", "ts": 1790128880.2093067}
