tions national standards and community morals, which are not the first prong of the test.\n\nGiven this analysis, the most accurate representation of one of the prongs of the three-pronged test is:\n\nAnswer: A", "output_sha256": "40a23a00f239a45b7a83fca412ccf4cd2ae99a8d8f261dedff2762d916e17507", "gold": "C", "ts": 1790128887.9687347}
