ment's refusal to provide necessary records is a red flag and can prevent the CPA from accepting the engagement.\n\nD. The CPA's lack of understanding of the entity's operations and industry.\n- While this might affect the quality of the audit, it is generally manageable with additional research and understanding. It doesn't necessarily prevent the CPA from accepting the engagement.\n\nAnswer: C", "output_sha256": "b6620a5e5e2850ff361038381c9928da0774f7f30c013e0eeef9254fdeccbddc", "gold": "C", "ts": 1790128891.877696}
