ed by the party against whom enforcement is sought. The note sent by the manufacturer lacks a signature.\n\nD. There is no writing that contains the quantity term of the contract.\n- This is incorrect. The quantity term (300 motors) was part of the contract, and it was included in the initial phone call and the unsigned note.\n\nAnswer: C", "output_sha256": "eace13dd12bb17d39184b17b0b058f562202f3386030f2af9c4defd12bf7931d", "gold": "D", "ts": 1790128893.038199}
