loss is on Code Sec. 1244 stock, it is considered a capital loss.\n\nAnswer: D", "output_sha256": "f4ce144c500de5d674140f23e8e8fe0535c954edb2e1152c312af2ae5266114d", "gold": "C", "ts": 1790128910.1548014}
