l is simpler and easier to interpret than a standard regression model with a continuous dependent variable, which often requires more complex transformations and assumptions.\n\nAnswer: C", "output_sha256": "83e0113720fbc10c162138910eb20e0b6a75ec37eaff2bffd531f1d03da15ba0", "gold": "D", "ts": 1790128919.2560358}
