ch. Therefore, it is inadmissible.\n3. **The z-brand stereo in the second-floor bedroom**: This stereo was found after the illegal search. The police had probable cause to search the home, so this stereo is admissible.\n\nGiven this analysis, the homeowner's motion should be granted with respect to the y-brand stereo and the x-brand stereo in the basement, as both are inadmissible due to the illegal search. The z-brand stereo is admissible.\n\nAnswer: C", "output_sha256": "60856a214f756e0c45e19b4d233ed5014df0a057dab827961bf996f11d2650ff", "gold": "C", "ts": 1790128920.7540226}
