em availability.\n\nD. This option highlights data backups, which is crucial for ensuring data integrity and availability in case of a failure. Off-site storage is a common practice to ensure data safety.\n\nGiven the context of a continuous availability environment, the most relevant aspect would be redundancy and backup systems.\n\nAnswer: B", "output_sha256": "c974d6a4994b18a8788bee43b4a42f28e3512a4f59baed5c0d556e865fa31f81", "gold": "B", "ts": 1790128931.4412959}
