ctor in moral intensity.\n- Option D includes \"Cultural immediacy,\" which is not a standard factor in moral intensity.\n- Option A includes \"Social consensus,\" which is not a standard factor in moral intensity.\n\nThis leaves us with option C: Proximity, Temporal immediacy, Social dissensus.\n\nAnswer: C", "output_sha256": "3b10b7313ce0f77e010921c5f4a691a1129654045c50889b0d683cde68d8d133", "gold": "A", "ts": 1790128935.8823907}
