th the alpha and the relationship between stock returns and market returns. This is a correct description of simple linear regression.\n\nD. Models market returns as a function of the stock returns and its beta.\n- This option suggests that the regression models market returns based on stock returns and beta, which is not the primary purpose of simple linear regression. Simple linear regression models stock returns based on market returns.\n\nGiven this analysis, the correct option is:\n\nAnswer: C", "output_sha256": "9c63bef8ebcc4745bbd866eb50db486d87407a07da2eb028eda803d57bb209d3", "gold": "C", "ts": 1790128945.6610253}
