ut not others.\n\nD. None of these: This is a catch-all option, suggesting that none of the other options fit the scenario.\n\nGiven the context, the issue of denying fundamental rights to some individuals but not others is best addressed by the concept of equal protection.\n\nAnswer: B", "output_sha256": "717615713b724e51515170fc034c2d4c4120f00a72fecf96e6462b22ae5b67d8", "gold": "B", "ts": 1790128964.862883}
