4.1}{104.1} = \\frac{1.9}{104.1} \\approx 0.0181 \\]\n\nTo convert this to a percentage:\n\\[ \\text{HPR} \\approx 0.0181 \\times 100 = 1.81\\% \\]\n\nHowever, this value is not among the given options. Let's recheck the calculations and verify if there's a mistake. The closest option to 1.81% is 2%.\n\nAnswer: D", "output_sha256": "529cb77bc054e9f98ed4917235639999d3127be90db35be15fb1d5f54152d38b", "gold": "D", "ts": 1790128966.1032772}
