\n\nD. Not be contained in a form supplied by the offeror.\n- This option is not relevant to the UCC's requirements for irrevocable offers. The UCC does not specify that the offer must not be contained in a form supplied by the offeror.\n\nAnswer: B", "output_sha256": "b04f0c2b63b32404506675315311b481f4ad6cd4c42a05f73eadc2aaefc09ec5", "gold": "B", "ts": 1790128968.183498}
