cted Return of Portfolio} = 6\\% \\]\n\nAnswer: <C>", "output_sha256": "438df9bb2a1f8cb6025f21187ce9fae4a4294458ed6b7833deaf5cde12fce134", "gold": "C", "ts": 1790128977.229373}
