} \\]\n\nGiven:\n- Sales for the first quarter: 30,000 units\n- Ending inventory for the first quarter: 12,000 units\n- Beginning inventory for the first quarter: 9,000 units\n\n\\[ \\text{Production} = 30,000 + 12,000 - 9,000 = 33,000 \\]\n\nAnswer: B", "output_sha256": "bc9f20c9be70b5d6dc7cb8ab3a144e1b92040ac4ddbab31a138f665dcc37890d", "gold": "B", "ts": 1790128978.7862582}
