its the definition of government entrapment. The addict was induced to commit the crime by the government agent's persistent and repeated requests, even though the addict initially refused.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is:\nAnswer: A", "output_sha256": "3cedf1e5cb9981c742b02020a49f491d647cfa91acbabe2b49d9a22550a204d7", "gold": "A", "ts": 1790128985.9648454}
