.\nC. processing power: This refers to the ability of the system to handle and process data. While it is important, the system crashing suggests that the buffer is the limiting factor.\nD. local storage: This is storage that is part of the immediate system and is used for temporary data storage. It is not relevant to the immediate issue of the search box.\n\nGiven the context, the most appropriate answer is A. buffer.\n\nAnswer: A", "output_sha256": "5d4cf18dd11ddffedba0eb6bc047589021dd57e3cc2b5f96cbe26f1115659300", "gold": "A", "ts": 1790129013.2900329}
