olved in polynomial time.\n- P_2 is not known to be solvable in polynomial time.\n\nThus, the correct statement is:\nAnswer: D", "output_sha256": "2194fe849fd018f0bbca55e4fdcbff1e6980dd82129a75bfd824ca6cad8441f8", "gold": "B", "ts": 1790129036.8716416}
