 \\( a \\), \\( b \\), and \\( c \\).\n\nGiven \\( T(1) = 7 \\):\n\\[ a(1)^2 + b(1) + c = 7 \\]\n\\[ a + b + c = 7 \\]\n\nGiven \\( T(2) = 10 \\):\n\\[ a(2)^2 + b(2) + c = 10 \\]\n\\[ 4a + 2b + c = 10 \\]\n\nGiven \\( T(3) = 16 \\):\n\\[ a(3)^2 + b(3) + c = 16 \\]\n\\[ 9a + 3b + c = 16 \\]\n\nWe now have a system of linear equations:\n1. \\( a + b + c = 7 \\)\n2. \\( 4a + 2b + c = 10 \\)\n3. \\( 9a + 3b + c = 16 \\)\n\nSubtract the first equation from the second:\n\\[ (4a + 2b + c) - (a + b + c) = 10 - 7 \\]\n\\[ 3", "output_sha256": "eefcf6d4ae1c1c83387e1900ff7c19a8b02f5317f5e6d4b67b84658361e4eed5", "gold": "C", "ts": 1790129044.9588544}
