m the decision on the merits with respect to the federal constitutional issue and abstain from reviewing the state constitutional issue.\n\nAnswer: D", "output_sha256": "7d825031f07df60a22090fb1a8d5ed46e7554b582bc327cd099c28ba4d720473", "gold": "A", "ts": 1790129064.1355612}
