[ B = \\frac{3 \\pm \\sqrt{9 - 8}}{2} \\]\n\\[ B = \\frac{3 \\pm 1}{2} \\]\n\nThis gives us two roots:\n\n\\[ B = 2 \\quad \\text{and} \\quad B = 1 \\]\n\nSince the roots are real and distinct, the process is stationary. A stationary process does not have unit roots or explosive behavior.\n\nAnswer: A", "output_sha256": "6fc57e323cd67805d9cab24cf1e3f28d37a5cd39874098ceaf7352c4b1161dc1", "gold": "B", "ts": 1790129074.1619694}
