ftsman's expert opinion of the water levels.**\n   - This is incorrect because the graphs are not the draftsman's expert opinion but are based on the original logs.\n\nGiven the context, the correct answer is:\n\nAnswer: C", "output_sha256": "58505b3e6d56fe1e09bc4edbce1460c46dd2bd84f784433754e33ac422259b33", "gold": "C", "ts": 1790129090.7638528}
