person must have a concrete stake in the outcome - This is a limitation on federal court jurisdiction. For a case to be justiciable, there must be a concrete, personal stake in the outcome, known as standing.\n\nConsidering the analysis, the option that is not an additional limitation on federal court jurisdiction is:\n\nAnswer: A", "output_sha256": "269da0c49de6bf292216707f2aad05cc276a7e0fcef6e11113b2d05a8574cab5", "gold": "A", "ts": 1790129093.8531718}
